<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns Aaa rating to Eureka Finance FRN.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns Aaa rating to Eureka Finance FRN.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Tuesday that it had assigned its Aaa rating to five billion yen worth of secured floating rate notes issued by Eureka Finance Ltd's Euro medium-term note programme.</p>
<p>Eureka Finance is a special purpose company incorporated in the Cayman Islands, Moody's said in a statement.</p>
<p>Moody's said the rating was based on a guarantee provided by Sumitomo Marine &amp; Fire Insurance Co Ltd, which has a senior unsecured debt rating of Aaa.</p>
</text>
